# Juno AI Computer Use Agent - Project Essentials ✅

## Project Status: PRODUCTION READY ✅

Juno is a **COMPLETE** Tauri v2 desktop application implementing Anthropic's Computer Use API with hierarchical agent architecture, advanced voice transcription capabilities, and **production-ready cloud control system**.

## Tech Stack
- **Frontend**: React/TypeScript with shadcn/ui components
- **Backend**: Rust with Tauri v2 framework
- **AI Integration**: Multi-provider support (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini)
- **Voice**: Custom Whisper.cpp-based transcription plugin
- **Platform**: macOS with native automation APIs
- **Cloud**: WebSocket-based remote control with security layer

## Core Features ✅ COMPLETE

### AI Computer Use (100% Implementation)
- **All 17 Anthropic Computer Use actions**: screenshot, mouse, keyboard, scroll, wait
- **File Operations**: str_replace_based_edit_tool with full CRUD capabilities
- **Shell Commands**: bash execution with session management
- **Timer System**: Long-running task management with context resumption

### Voice Interaction Modes
- **Agent Mode**: Alt+D toggles voice input for AI agent conversations and task execution
  - Voice → Transcription → AI Agent Processing → Agent Response/Actions
  - Full hierarchical agent system with orchestrator and specialists
  - No direct text pasting - AI responses through chat interface
- **Dictation Mode**: Configurable key (default spacebar) for immediate voice-to-text typing
  - Voice → Transcription → Text insertion at cursor location
  - Pure transcription service with no AI processing
  - Immediate transcription start (0ms delay)
  - 500ms threshold for commitment vs cancellation
  - Smart cancellation with key passthrough

### Hierarchical Agent System
- **Orchestrator Agent**: Maintains personality and conversation memory
- **Specialist Agents**: Browser, Desktop, File domain experts
- **Tool Delegation**: Intelligent routing based on task analysis
- **Memory Separation**: Persistent orchestrator memory, isolated specialist memory

### Cloud Control System ✅ NEW
- **WebSocket Connectivity**: Production-ready remote access infrastructure
- **Device Authentication**: Secure device registration and credential management
- **Command Processing**: Comprehensive remote command execution system
- **Security Layer**: Encryption, audit logging, and authorization protocols
- **Production Connector**: Robust connection management with auto-reconnection

